  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "On Tian Ti, ten formless Gu Immortal consciousnesses of the ten great sects call this generation of elite disciples mostly ordinary, then single out Spirit Butterfly Valley’s Xiao Qi Xing among a few excellent juniors before turning to opening Hu Immortal Inheritance. Xiao Qi Xing enters that inheritance after Feng Jin Huang, ahead of Ying Sheng Ji and others.",
      "chapters": [
        365
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_tian_ti",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "loc_spirit_butterfly_valley",
        "char_xiao_qi_xing",
        "inh_hu_immortal_inheritance",
        "char_feng_jin_huang",
        "char_ying_sheng_ji"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In Divine Emperor City’s painting world, Xiao Qi Xing tells Chen Da Jiang and Sun Yao that even Spirit Butterfly Valley did not inform him of the human path plan, and that he asked his great grandfather. Chen Da Jiang names that great grandfather as Lord Gu Immortal Xiao Bai Hong. Shen Shang later judges that Xiao Bai Hong is too shortsighted and does not know he has harmed his own great-grandson by sharing that inside information.",
      "chapters": [
        1992
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "painting-world-counsel",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_divine_emperor_city",
        "char_chen_da_jiang",
        "char_sun_yao",
        "char_shen_shang"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Narration names him as Spirit Butterfly Valley’s Gu Immortal Xiao Bai Hong when he obtains wealth Gu in treasure yellow heaven and hands them to rank five Gu Master Xiao Qi Xing, stated as his great-grandson and one of the ten children of human path with huge Heavenly Court support. Xiao Qi Xing explains a human path plan around justice Immortal Gu and the killer move commander of justice. Xiao Bai Hong laughs, strokes his head, and says he will use all their resources to help.",
      "chapters": [
        2262
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "wealth-gu-and-justice-plan",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_wealth_gu",
        "sys_gu_master",
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "gu_justice_gu"
      ]
    }
  ],
